<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal says no bids to drain 7-day funds.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal says no bids to drain 7-day funds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said there was no demand at its offer to drain money market liquidity with seven-day certificates at a fixed rate of 5.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
